# CI gate

Before claiming a change is complete, run `.\scripts\check.ps1` or the same commands:

```
cargo fmt --all -- --check
cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings
cargo test --workspace
```

- Do not skip clippy. Do not use `--no-verify` on commits unless the user asked.
- GPU capture/encode tests that need a display or hardware MFT stay `#[ignore]` so Windows GitHub-hosted runners still go green.
- Live preview of the recording is not an MVP CI concern (preview is out of MVP).
